{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-2-1","title":"Psalms 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The kingdom of Christ. 10 Kings are exhorted to accept it.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2963. B.C. 1042. Why. 18:42; 46:6; 83:4-8; Isa 8:9; Lu 18:32; Ac 4:25 rage. or, tumultuously assemble. Lu 22:1,2,5,22,23; Ac 16:22; 17:5,6; 19:28-32 people. Mt 21:38; Joh 11:49,50; Ac 5:33; Re 17:14 imagine. Heb. meditate.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-2","title":"Psalms 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>kings. 10; 48:4; 110:5; Mt 2:16; Lu 13:31; 23:11,12; Ac 12:1-6; Re 17:12-14 rulers. Mt 26:3,59; 27:1; Ac 4:5-8 Lord. Ex 16:7; Pr 21:30; Joh 15:23; Ac 9:4 anointed. 45:7; 89:20; Isa 61:1; Joh 1:41; 3:34; Ac 10:38; Heb 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-3","title":"Psalms 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Jer 5:5; Lu 19:14,27; 1Pe 2:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-4","title":"Psalms 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>He that. 11:4; 68:33; 115:3; Isa 40:22; 57:15; 66:1 shall laugh. 37:13; 53:5; 59:8; 2Ki 19:21; Pr 1:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-5","title":"Psalms 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Then. 50:16-22; Isa 11:4; 66:6; Mt 22:7; 23:33-36; Lu 19:27,43,44 Re 1:16; 19:15 vex. or, trouble. sore. 110:5,6; Zec 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-6","title":"Psalms 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Yet. 45:6; 89:27,36,37; 110:1,2; Isa 9:6,7; Da 7:13,14; Mt 28:18 Ac 2:34-36; 5:30,31; Eph 1:22; Php 2:9-11 set. Heb. anointed. my, etc. Heb. Zion, the hill of myholiness. 48:1,2; 50:2; 78:68; 132:13,14; Heb 12:22; Re 14:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-7","title":"Psalms 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the decree. or, for a decree. 148:6; Job 23:13; Isa 46:10 Thou. Mt 3:17; 8:29; 16:16; 17:5; Ac 8:37; 13:33; Ro 1:4; Heb 1:5; 3:6 Heb 5:5,8 this. 89:27; Joh 1:14,18; 3:16; Heb 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-8","title":"Psalms 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Ask. Joh 17:4,5 and I. 22:27; 72:8; Da 7:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-9","title":"Psalms 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>21:8,9; 89:23; 110:5,6; Isa 30:14; 60:12; Jer 19:11; Da 2:44 Mt 21:44; Re 2:26,27; 12:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-10","title":"Psalms 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Be wise. Jer 6:8; Ho 14:9 O. 45:12; 72:10,11; Isa 49:23; 52:15; 60:3,10,11 be instructed. 82:1-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-11","title":"Psalms 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Serve. 89:7; Heb 12:28,29 rejoice. 95:1-8; 97:1; 99:1; 119:120; Php 2:12; Heb 4:1,2; 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-2-12","title":"Psalms 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Kiss. Ge 41:40,43,44; 1Sa 10:1; 1Ki 19:18; Ho 13:2; Joh 5:23 Son. 7 and, etc.Or, \"and ye lose the way,\" or, \"and ye perish in the way.\" The LXX., and Vulgate have, \"and ye perish from the righteous way:\" and the Syriac, \"and ye perish from his way.\"</p>\n<p>ye perish. 1:6; Joh 14:6 when. 5; 2Th 1:8,9; Re 6:16,17; 14:9-11 Blessed. 40:4; 84:12; 146:3-5; Pr 16:20; Isa 26:3,4; 30:18; Jer 17:7; Ro 9:33 Ro 10:11; Eph 1:12; 1Pe 1:21; 2:6</p>"}]}